WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.962
Welcome to Module 4 of Global Secure
Access as the Identity-Aware Network:

2
00:00:04.962 --> 00:00:08.263
private applications and
administrative paths.

3
00:00:08.263 --> 00:00:13.612
A V P N gives a user an address on the
network and lets the network decide the rest.

4
00:00:13.612 --> 00:00:16.983
Private Access gives each
application its own path:

5
00:00:16.983 --> 00:00:21.763
its own hosts and ports, its own assigned
group, its own Conditional Access.

6
00:00:21.763 --> 00:00:27.464
This module covers Steps 6 and 10 of the
Global Secure Access implementation guide,

7
00:00:27.464 --> 00:00:31.820
and takes about fifty minutes, plus
a lab in your own test tenant.
